'''Goggles Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be obtained from pressing a special icon in the [[Cat Guide]] during the [[Anniversary/13th Year|13th Anniversary]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

