|ID = 834
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Goggles Cat
|name2 = Green Nyanko Ranger
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Green Nyanko Ranger''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This Cat is an anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] crowd-controller that aims to provide [[Freeze]] coverage from a surprisingly high range. Even with the presence of good Freeze units for both traits, such as [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] respectively, this Cat's superior survivability gives them a niche as a standalone crowd-controller in otherwise volatile environments despite their high recharge time. Additionally, they can act as a good layer of secondary defense in the case that your primary stack of crowd-controllers end up biting the dust prematurely.

One case where Green Nyanko Ranger is preferable over the aforementioned iCat is against [[J.K. Bun Bun]]. While iCat gets outranged and struggles to land hits, Green Nyanko Ranger can safely control him thanks to their high range. This is especially potent on cash-tight stages, where numbers-based crowd-controllers like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] may drain your wallet.

While they may appear expensive, Green Nyanko Ranger's real price tag is actually 960¢ thanks to their Cost Down XL [[Cat Combo|Combo]], which reduces the cost of all [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] by 20%. The bulk of them have an unreasonably high cost, making this Cat Combo an absolute must-use when running multiple Nyanko Rangers. Furthermore, they can be used synergistically with [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Ranger]] to provide mutually beneficial effects and utilities. Green Nyanko Ranger can keep Yellow Nyanko Ranger safe from Dark enemies with Freeze, while the latter provides both of them Wave Immunity to better handle enemies like [[Two Can]].

As a Special Cat, they even have great utility {{4c}} restriction stages, where iCat isn't available, as well as in mixed stages with Red and Dark enemies like [[Principal's Rebellion]]. Overall, Green Nyanko Ranger's excellent potential as a powerful crowd-controller more than justifies their flaws, and they should be considered over alternatives in dangerous stages where short-ranged options might falter.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Combo Slave}}

